// Source of the `iron-mine` kit (tools/town/kits/iron-mine.json): the iron mine on Coalman's Brow, the one mining loop a new
// player can run (pickaxe from MINER level 1 at the miners' supply till, iron rocks, the furnace, iron bars sold at the hardware
// store). `town fit` reads each row's prefab and component GUIDs from here. Coordinates are offsets from the centre of the
// hostless plot the slot anchors on (frame: the plot, unturned, x east, z north). The ore rocks are the core IronOre.et (node
// `iron`: pickaxe, 5 pieces, 5 minutes to grow back), the furnace is the pack LF_MineFurnace.et (`furnace-iron-mine`, 3 nuggets to 1 bar, no
// level), the desk is the MINER workplace, the sign def `coalmans-brow-mine` is in the pack's
// Configs/Signs/LF_Signs_Everon1989/LF_Signs_Mine.conf, the iron buyer on its counter is the pack LF_IronBuyer_Everon1989.et (pays the
// `hardware` iron row of the buyer demand table; the dock wholesale takes the rest). Portal, heaps, cart, picks and lamps are the
// `mine-entrance` kit's props.
GenericEntity Mine_Portal : "{02128ED43CA97BCF}Prefabs/Structures/Industrial/CoalMineShaft_01/CoalMineShaft_USSR_01_end_buried.et" {
